<title>HONG KONG: Jingwei Textile H1 net 35.72 mln yuan.</title>
<headline>Jingwei Textile H1 net 35.72 mln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.10</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    0.02</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    35.72</p>
<p>    Turnover		     330.37</p>
<p>    Company name		 Jingwei Textile Machinery Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 16 to 20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Oct 7</p>
<p>NOTE - Chinese textile machinery maker Jingwei Textile was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on February 2, 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it had proforma net profit of 34.65 million in the first half of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843-6368</p>
